<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>06 · METHOD — ARMS</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        Four arms, one variable each — 962 records behind them
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>EVERY NUMBER TRAVELS THE SAME PATH</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}>
                {[
                    ['Raw data', 'licence and md5 recorded'],
                    ['Frozen splits', 'official indices, hashed'],
                    ['One arm at a time', 'same rows, same seeds'],
                    ['One record per run', 'R², MAE, hashes'],
                    ['Λ per cell, κ per dataset', 'after a reconciliation gate'],
                ].map(([head, sub], i) => (
                    <Box key={head} style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        {i > 0 ? <svg width='30' height='20' viewBox='0 0 30 20' style={{ marginTop: 3, marginBottom: 3 }}>
                            <line x1='15' y1='0' x2='15' y2='11' stroke='#8FA3BC' strokeWidth='2' />
                            <polygon points='15,19 9,10 21,10' fill='#8FA3BC' />
                        </svg> : null}
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '8px 12px', background: i === 2 ? '#16233A' : '#111B2E', border: '1px solid ' + (i === 2 ? '#2F4A75' : '#24334C'), borderRadius: 5 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{head}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 1 }}>{sub}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 720 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#16233A', padding: '11px 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 140, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Arm</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>What it changes</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 110, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'right' }}>Runs</Text>
                </Box>
                {[
                    ['A1 floor', 'Predicts the training mean — reference only', '48', '#8FA3BC', '#A8B8CE'],
                    ['A2 unit', '205 RDKit descriptors + 2048-bit fingerprint → XGBoost, 30 tuning trials', '328', '#FFFFFF', '#FFFFFF'],
                    ['A3 chain', 'chemprop 2.1.0 MPNN — official hyper-parameters, tuned zero times', '538', '#4D8DFF', '#4D8DFF'],
                    ['A4 chain', 'polyBERT frozen encoder + ridge head (capacity capped)', '48', '#4D8DFF', '#4D8DFF'],
                    ['A5 chain', 'Would inject chain input at a fixed architecture', '0', '#FF6B6B', '#FF6B6B'],
                ].map(([arm, change, runs, nameColor, runColor]) => (
                    <Box key={arm} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', padding: '12px 14px', background: '#0E1728', borderBottom: '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 140, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: nameColor }}>{arm}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 470, fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{change}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 110, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: runColor, textAlign: 'right' }}>{runs}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFB020', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                A5 is zero because its inputs do not exist in the data — see slide 13. It is logged as not constructible, never as &quot;no gain&quot;.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>
            4,897 provenance checks before any table is written — 4,832 ok / 65 exempt / 0 fail.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>7 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
